  |                   ++++++++</pre></div></div><div class="df think"><span class="dk" style="color:var(--accent-hover)">Analysing</span><div>I cannot start a session: there is no binary until the borrow checker is satisfied. <code>rustc</code> offers <code>.clone()</code> — and even warns it “might not be your desired behavior”. That warning is the interesting part. Rather than guess, let's apply the suggestion and <b>watch what it does at runtime</b>; the test will tell us if it is right.</div></div></div>
